#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:73
#: 70bc7810da4c4e97a6477aad8bc18236
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:75
#: 89eb1282ca8a4095a2ea264ad20a707d
msgid ""
"RC input is configured by default via the USART3 RX input. It supports all "
"serial RC protocols except PPM."
msgstr "RC 输入默认通过 USART3 RX 输入配置。支持除 PPM 外的所有串行 RC 协议。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:77
#: be9770b74e1a4b999b4c477f53e8f0c2
msgid ""
"Note: If the receiver is FPort the receiver must be tied to the USART3 TX "
"pin , RSSI_TYPE set to 3, and SERIAL3_OPTIONS must be set to 7 (invert "
"TX/RX, half duplex). For full duplex like CRSF/ELRS use both RX1 and TX1 and"
" set RSSI_TYPE also to 3."
msgstr ""
"注意：若接收机为 FPort，必须将接收机连接至 USART3 TX 引脚，将 RSSI_TYPE 设为 3，并将 SERIAL3_OPTIONS 设为"
" 7（反转 TX/RX，半双工）。对于 CRSF/ELRS 等全双工协议，同时使用 RX1 和 TX1，并同样将 RSSI_TYPE 设为 3。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:82
#: 4c9c3308d793496e8b97192928dc2ba6
msgid "OSD Support"
msgstr "OSD 支持"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:84
#: 3ec37237863948728190e7ed37297506
msgid "The KakuteF4-Wing supports OSD using OSD_TYPE 1 (MAX7456 driver)."
msgstr "KakuteF4-Wing 支持使用 OSD_TYPE 1（MAX7456 驱动）的 OSD。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:87
#: f0564cc4bdf5411d910e16b3b716bf8e
msgid "PWM Output"
msgstr "PWM 输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:89
#: b5522d0f37ef436fa900844c4bde744e
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4 supports up to 7 PWM outputs. All outputs support DShot. "
"Outputs 1-4 support BiDirDshot."
msgstr "KakuteF4 最多支持 7 路 PWM 输出。所有输出均支持 DShot，输出 1-4 支持 BiDirDShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:91
#: af7d2b4c2f8a460d845c7c08ecee9c5e
msgid "The PWM is in 5 groups:"
msgstr "PWM 分为 5 组："

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:94
#: 33168da0785f4ce1bdb9e507a1dfac13
msgid "PWM 1-2 in group1"
msgstr "PWM 1-2 属于第 1 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:95
#: 48f0a7254baf45b583787e63d0d86526
msgid "PWM 3-4 in group2"
msgstr "PWM 3-4 属于第 2 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:96
#: da136903ff8c4be095632c713b1197cb
msgid "PWM 5-6 in group3"
msgstr "PWM 5-6 属于第 3 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:97
#: 3cb6dabe416e439b80d189215819af95
msgid "PWM 7   in group4"
msgstr "PWM 7 属于第 4 组"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:99
#: de962f049a3143ba8044b093fd69b2cc
msgid ""
"Channels within the same group need to use the same output rate. If any "
"channel in a group uses DShot then all channels in the group need to use "
"DShot."
msgstr "同一组内的通道必须使用相同的输出速率。如果某组中任一通道使用 DShot，则该组中所有通道都必须使用 DShot。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:104
#: c5bac0149cb94b7cb20dc5a21dcd1361
msgid "Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:106
#: 615dd4bef103440dab2475501f65f821
msgid ""
"The board has a builting voltage and current sensor. The current sensor can "
"read up to ?? Amps. The voltage sensor can handle up to 6S LiPo batteries."
msgstr "该飞控板内置电压和电流传感器。电流传感器最大量程为 ?? 安培，电压传感器支持最高 6S 锂电池。"

