#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:120
#: 8984cfe76a0c45d683462451ae2a80c8
msgid "Compass"
msgstr "罗盘"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:122
#: af391a061ff0411f93809ad6238fd584
msgid ""
"The KakuteF4-Wing does not have a built-in compass, but you can attach an "
"external compass using I2C on the SDA and SCL pads."
msgstr "KakuteF4-Wing 没有内置罗盘，但可通过 SDA 和 SCL 焊盘使用 I2C 连接外置罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:125
#: a4093b1750bb46b281b23f65c13dda35
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:127
#: b3ff83ca221a4063b7171c135e7ae23e
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found at https://firmware.ardupilot.org in "
"sub-folders labeled “KakuteF4-Wing”."
msgstr "该飞控板的固件可在 https://firmware.ardupilot.org 的「KakuteF4-Wing」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:129
#: 31514bb7f71a4daeb070f67fffff227e
msgid ""
"Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the boot "
"button pressed. Then you should load the \"KakuteF4-Wing_bl.hex\" firmware, "
"using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""
"首次固件加载可在按住 Boot 按钮插入 USB 时通过 DFU 完成。然后使用您喜欢的 DFU "
"烧写工具加载「KakuteF4-Wing_bl.hex」固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-KakuteF4-Wing.rst:133
#: 7ebb1a5c21124e23a5c2b16015288130
msgid "Subsequently, you can update firmware with Mission Planner."
msgstr "之后可使用 Mission Planner 更新固件。"
